                            Statanly Technologies develops an enterprise AI platform for video and audio analytics, designed for industry, retail, HoReCa, transport infrastructure and corporate process automation.
                        </span>
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <span data-i18n="about.p2">
                            The company combines expertise in Computer Vision, Speech Analytics, Large Language Models, Generative AI, MLOps and the development of high-load AI systems for enterprise customers.
                        </span>
                    </p>

                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>
                            <span data-i18n="about.li1">
                                More than 400 completed AI projects for large industrial and commercial customers, including metallurgy, energy, manufacturing, retail and hospitality.
                            </span>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>
                            <span data-i18n="about.li2">
                                A proprietary event analytics platform that turns natural-language tasks into live AI scenarios and real-time events for different industries and production sectors.
                            </span>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>
                            <span data-i18n="about.li3">
                                A world-class team of engineers, PhD-level AI researchers and data scientists with hundreds of scientific publications in AI in peer-reviewed international journals, AI/ML awards, experience in the world’s largest technology giants and graduates of top computer science universities.
                            </span>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>
                            <span data-i18n="about.li4">
                                Development of industry AI ecosystems that combine ready-made models, Generative AI, VLM and tools for creating new scenarios for specific business needs. The team includes graduates of the world’s leading technical universities.
                            </span>
                        </li>

                    </ul>
                    <div class="about-platform-note mt-4">
                        <i class="bi bi-stars"></i>
                        <strong data-i18n="about.platform.note">
                            Users do not need AI expertise: STATANLY turns a natural-language request into data preparation, model creation, scenario logic and deployment.
                        </strong>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <p>
                        <span data-i18n="about.platform.p1">
                            The company’s core product is an AI Factory for event analytics based on Computer Vision, Speech Analytics, Large Language Models (LLM), VLM and Generative AI. It is designed to create intelligent models and live AI scenarios for the needs of different industries.
                        </span>
                        <br><br>

                        <span data-i18n="about.platform.p2">
                            The main idea of the AI Factory is to simplify the creation of new event analytics scenarios: a user describes a task in natural language, and STATANLY helps turn it into a working AI scenario for monitoring, detection, alerts and real-time analytics.
                        </span>
                        <br><br>

                        <span data-i18n="about.platform.p3">
                            The AI Factory combines video streams, audio data, events and business processes into a unified AI environment. It allows companies to use ready-made modules, create new scenarios, connect data sources, fine-tune models and adapt analytics to a specific site, process or operational task.
                        </span>
                        <br><br>

                        <span data-i18n="about.platform.p4">
                            The AI Factory powers solutions for industrial safety, violation control, workforce efficiency analytics, production analytics, quality control, retail, HoReCa, transport infrastructure, smart environments and operational process automation.
                        </span>
                    </p>
